From 1dd514d08cf5b03e02c5d39337a19e5bea9c05d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:51:40 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: the attendant's and the party manager's menus

scene/arena_menu.c is a new object in the Battle Arena overlay. The attendant
asks Solo or Multiplayer and then the tournament (the Monster Gauntlet is the
only one); the man to the counter's right, once the linked-win teller, is now
the party manager: Characters, Djinn, Psynergy and the item shops, opening the
real Shop_Run on Xian's stock. A win pays 200 coins plus 100 for each earlier
win in the series and heals the party. battle_arena.c keeps only the hooks.
The overlay's import lists gain the functions the new code calls. Switch:
ARENA_TRAINING.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
